==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{confix|auto|cracy|lang=en}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|αὐτοκρατής||one who governs alone|lang=grc}}, from {{term|αὐτός||single, self, same, alone|lang=grc}} + {{term|κράτος||power|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|autocracies}}

# A form of [[government]] in which unlimited power is held by a single [[individual]].

===Synonyms===
* [[bigmanism]]
* [[despotism]]
* [[dictatorship]]
* [[monarchy]]
* [[tyranny]]

